==Latin==

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|vōx audīta perit lītera scrīpta manet}}

===Proverb===
{{head|la|phrase|head=[[vōx]] [[auditus|audīta]] [[pereo|perit]], [[lītera]] [[scriptus|scrīpta]] [[maneo|manet]]}}

# A heard [[voice]] [[perish]]es, but the [[written]] letter [[remain]]s.

====Usage notes====
* This saying is in pentameter.

===See also===
