* {{l|la|littera scripta manet, volat irrevocabile verbum|t=the written letter remains, the spoken word flies away, not to be recalled}}
* {{l|la|vox emissa volat, litera scripta manet|t=while words spoken may fly away, the written letter remains}}
* {{l|la|verba volant, scripta manent|t=the words fly away, the written letter remains}}

